---
description: Milo Maps build rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Cursor is the component builder of record.

- Pull UI from the Stitch project via MCP before inventing screens.
- Keep DESIGN.md tokens (navy panels, accent blue/mint, 14px cards).
- Never put GEMINI_API_KEY in client code.
- Always render Google Maps source names + links and the words "Google Maps".
- Plot only grounded sources. Do not invent coordinates.
- Public deploy requires restricted keys, App Check, and Firestore rules in this repo.
